        "created_at": "2018-06-15T16:38:55.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>A quick question re SCRPG mechanics.&nbsp;</p><p>Legacy's player says \"I want to pick up this Spiderbot, and throw it at that other one, trying blow them both up.\"</p><p>Is there anything in the Starter Kit rules that I'm mising that allows for this, or should I just wing it, for example having the player make a single Attack roll and applying -2 to to the damage on each target? Or perhaps Min die damage to each target?</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:51:23.620Z",
